WEBVTT

01:41.700 --> 01:45.990
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.890 --> 01:49.030
[Episode 2]

01:53.039 --> 01:54.039
Oh no. Oh no.

01:54.560 --> 01:56.150
Su Yishui is so sinister.

01:56.630 --> 01:58.060
He's already ready to refine me.

01:59.200 --> 02:00.230
It's fire tempering...

02:01.070 --> 02:02.280
I'm really going to become

02:02.280 --> 02:02.760
a big lump

02:02.780 --> 02:03.700
of Tonic Core!

02:06.120 --> 02:07.000
Master!

02:07.590 --> 02:09.080
You can't speedrun progress!

02:09.160 --> 02:10.870
You'll kill me!

02:11.360 --> 02:12.120
Cultivation

02:12.360 --> 02:13.750
should be done step by step!

02:13.870 --> 02:15.440
I'm willing to grow together

02:15.470 --> 02:16.470
with my sect seniors!

02:23.750 --> 02:26.240
What the hell is this place?

03:12.170 --> 03:12.850
Ling Xiao.

03:13.580 --> 03:14.790
What did you do?

03:19.770 --> 03:21.480
It doesn't hurt much anymore.

03:27.870 --> 03:29.470
You mustn't overexert yourself.

03:30.980 --> 03:31.980
Don't worry.

03:32.520 --> 03:34.040
I will persist.

03:35.079 --> 03:36.120
I promise I will

03:37.000 --> 03:37.800
save you!

03:39.470 --> 03:40.710
I thought we'll get to

03:41.520 --> 03:43.280
settle the score when we meet again

03:44.400 --> 03:46.079
and I'll get closure from you.

03:48.240 --> 03:49.310
It's been 18 years.

03:51.100 --> 03:52.470
I'm still waiting for your answer.

03:54.470 --> 03:56.000
But you forgot everything.

03:59.350 --> 04:00.910
I'll wait for you to remember that day.

04:02.240 --> 04:03.960
A grudge can't be left unresolved.

04:21.630 --> 04:22.390
Yes.

04:22.880 --> 04:24.830
Everything's going as we planned.

04:25.110 --> 04:27.080
Xue Ranran has entered Mount Wester,

04:27.280 --> 04:29.200
becoming entangled with Su Yishui again.

04:29.830 --> 04:32.360
He actually forced his past master to be his disciple.

04:32.720 --> 04:33.830
Su Yishui

04:34.100 --> 04:36.250
is really unscrupulous.

04:36.700 --> 04:39.110
The unfinished great cause from 18 years ago

04:39.390 --> 04:42.190
will finally begin again!

04:46.530 --> 04:48.390
[Main Hall, Scarlet Sect]

04:49.480 --> 04:50.870
Greetings, My Lord.

04:53.630 --> 04:54.390
Elder Tu.

04:55.390 --> 04:57.659
You still haven’t found the person I want.

04:58.360 --> 04:59.159
Please calm down.

05:01.250 --> 05:02.740
Only the Five Heavenly Sects of

05:02.970 --> 05:03.970
the Eternals, Hollows,

05:04.270 --> 05:05.000
Scuds, Suns,

05:05.120 --> 05:05.750
and Westers,

05:05.870 --> 05:07.120
and the capital's Exotic Pavilion

05:07.750 --> 05:08.750
can get Reincarnation Fruits

05:09.290 --> 05:10.490
at Mount Absolute.

05:11.620 --> 05:13.260
I'll send spies there right away.

05:13.310 --> 05:13.870
No need.

05:15.510 --> 05:16.630
If you can't do it,

05:17.120 --> 05:18.430
don’t act on your own.

05:19.270 --> 05:21.270
Just follow my arrangements.

05:22.830 --> 05:23.190
Yes.

05:26.030 --> 05:28.710
[Dining Room, Mount Wester]

05:27.310 --> 05:27.920
Ranran.

05:27.970 --> 05:28.790
Are you okay?

05:29.220 --> 05:29.870
Where did

05:29.870 --> 05:30.750
Master take you to?

05:31.230 --> 05:32.800
There's a Westerly Valley at the back.

05:33.300 --> 05:34.950
It's just like a huge stove.

05:35.159 --> 05:36.600
Did you offend Master?

05:37.130 --> 05:38.010
Why is he so strict

05:38.040 --> 05:38.800
with you?

05:40.950 --> 05:42.630
I really want to eat meat buns,

05:43.120 --> 05:44.000
roasted duck legs—

05:44.030 --> 05:46.510
Should a cultivator be dreaming of feasting?

05:47.870 --> 05:48.680
As they say,

05:48.700 --> 05:50.260
cultivate your energy to live long

05:50.530 --> 05:52.320
and relinquish food to become immortal.

05:53.000 --> 05:54.390
If you can't even abstain from food,

05:54.409 --> 05:55.490
what are you cultivating for?

05:56.040 --> 05:57.430
Do you think I want to?

05:57.510 --> 05:57.800
I...

05:58.680 --> 05:59.310
Forget it.

05:59.750 --> 06:00.630
My feud with Master

06:00.630 --> 06:01.680
is my own business.

06:02.160 --> 06:03.800
I can't drag them into it.

06:04.430 --> 06:05.040
Ranran.

06:05.270 --> 06:06.360
What are you afraid of?

06:07.000 --> 06:07.480
What?

06:10.290 --> 06:12.090
I can smell human emotions.

06:12.450 --> 06:14.560
You always have this smell of cold wind

06:14.800 --> 06:15.480
with gunpowder

06:15.480 --> 06:16.490
about to ignite.

06:16.940 --> 06:18.540
It's the feeling of nervousness and fear.

06:18.920 --> 06:19.900
I just think

06:20.590 --> 06:21.240
Wester Sect

06:21.270 --> 06:22.600
is really a bit eerie.

06:23.190 --> 06:23.800
Master

06:23.800 --> 06:25.000
even killed his master.

06:25.110 --> 06:26.070
Aren't you scared?

06:28.120 --> 06:29.680
How dare you talk about Master behind his back?

06:30.450 --> 06:31.060
That demoness

06:31.330 --> 06:32.690
was captivated by Master's looks

06:32.920 --> 06:34.270
and held him hostage on the mountain.

06:34.390 --> 06:35.750
Master suffered from

06:35.750 --> 06:36.870
her torture.

06:37.480 --> 06:38.870
He hates Mu Qingge.

06:38.960 --> 06:39.960
Shouldn’t she be killed?

06:40.510 --> 06:42.060
Master used to be pretty?

06:44.760 --> 06:45.850
Don't you think you're focusing

06:45.870 --> 06:47.140
on the wrong point?

06:47.510 --> 06:48.560
The point is

06:48.750 --> 06:50.310
Master was cursed by the demoness

06:50.720 --> 06:52.070
because he tried to rid the world of evil.

06:52.190 --> 06:52.750
That's how

06:53.120 --> 06:54.240
he was disfigured.

06:54.870 --> 06:56.560
If he can kill his master

06:56.830 --> 06:58.040
for his cultivation,

06:58.190 --> 06:59.270
what else can't he do?

06:59.430 --> 07:00.160
You're wrong.

07:02.510 --> 07:03.310
-Senior.
-Senior.

07:04.830 --> 07:05.650
Your master

07:05.680 --> 07:07.270
is a little aloof,

07:07.520 --> 07:08.440
but he's a great person.

07:10.600 --> 07:11.870
This is the tonic from Guardian.

07:15.600 --> 07:17.430
Guardian may be a harsh mentor,

07:17.950 --> 07:18.950
but in a few days,

07:19.040 --> 07:20.310
you'll realize his well intentions.

07:33.310 --> 07:33.830
Guardian.

07:34.830 --> 07:35.920
It seems Wei Jiu's still on our case.

07:35.950 --> 07:37.070
He hasn't stopped his search.

07:38.659 --> 07:40.010
I heard the blood of some Black Dragon

07:40.600 --> 07:42.070
can conceal spiritual energy.

07:43.040 --> 07:43.720
Find out

07:43.870 --> 07:45.159
where that Black Dragon is.

07:45.960 --> 07:46.470
Yes.

07:48.070 --> 07:49.340
I also heard that

07:50.210 --> 07:51.130
you sent that demoness

07:51.159 --> 07:52.450
to get refined in Westerly Valley.

07:53.070 --> 07:54.110
Does she deserve to use

07:54.140 --> 07:54.659
such a

07:54.800 --> 07:55.870
precious refining ground?

07:57.370 --> 07:58.570
Her heart damage is beyond

07:58.600 --> 07:59.510
my expectations.

08:00.430 --> 08:01.560
After reversing our master-disciple pact,

08:01.940 --> 08:03.300
I can transfer my power to her,

08:03.720 --> 08:04.750
but it's just a drop in the bucket.

08:06.240 --> 08:07.190
You're right.

08:07.950 --> 08:09.560
The sooner she repairs her heart,

08:09.990 --> 08:10.920
the sooner she can lift

08:10.920 --> 08:11.770
the Burning Curse

08:11.800 --> 08:12.770
she cast on you.

08:13.190 --> 08:13.890
That's why

08:13.920 --> 08:14.950
you accepted her as a disciple.

08:24.630 --> 08:26.680
There is no ready-made wine in Mount Wester.

08:27.430 --> 08:28.720
But Senior Yu Tong said

08:29.060 --> 08:30.840
the yeast for Mu Qingge's old wine

08:30.870 --> 08:32.429
is stored at the back kitchen.

08:32.840 --> 08:33.890
I just learned

08:33.909 --> 08:35.280
the Object-Summoning spell.

08:35.960 --> 08:36.840
I should try

08:37.240 --> 08:38.840
using it to get some yeast.

08:43.230 --> 08:44.830
With the thought in my heart,

08:45.380 --> 08:46.830
my wish is your command.

08:47.180 --> 08:47.630
Come to me!

08:51.200 --> 08:51.510
What...

08:51.660 --> 08:53.030
What's going on?

08:57.210 --> 08:58.540
I think I feel something.

09:10.270 --> 09:11.150
Stupid bug!

09:11.170 --> 09:12.360
Trying to mess with me, huh?

09:12.840 --> 09:13.640
Can't I even talk?

09:13.670 --> 09:14.270
It's really tough

09:14.270 --> 09:15.030
being Master's master!

09:18.780 --> 09:20.060
Trying to run?

09:20.550 --> 09:22.150
How dare you bully me?

09:23.960 --> 09:24.870
Watch this.

09:25.180 --> 09:25.850
I'll take you down!

09:41.870 --> 09:43.470
This is her old ruler.

09:43.940 --> 09:45.150
It was manipulated by

09:45.170 --> 09:45.680
her power.

09:50.080 --> 09:51.550
With the thought in my heart,

09:51.910 --> 09:53.480
my wish is your command.

09:54.240 --> 09:54.550
Come to me!

09:59.280 --> 10:00.710
The yeast made by the demoness

10:00.740 --> 10:02.140
is so mellow and rich.

10:02.720 --> 10:03.750
I can make great wine now!

10:07.240 --> 10:07.720
It's fine.

10:07.930 --> 10:08.600
You may leave.

10:10.910 --> 10:11.390
Yes.

10:12.960 --> 10:13.550
Wait.

10:15.390 --> 10:17.200
Only call her Xue Ranran from now on.

10:20.080 --> 10:20.670
Yes.

10:22.380 --> 10:25.640
[Meteor Pavilion, Eternal Sect]

10:23.030 --> 10:23.910
The Demon Detector is spinning!

10:24.190 --> 10:25.000
Abnormality with the Spirit Spring!

10:31.790 --> 10:32.550
Back then,

10:32.860 --> 10:33.720
we tried our best

10:33.750 --> 10:34.940
to subdue the demoness.

10:35.430 --> 10:36.910
But the Spirit Spring wasn't on her.

10:37.800 --> 10:38.850
In all these years,

10:39.130 --> 10:40.290
the Demon Detector has

10:40.320 --> 10:41.820
never sensed a trace of the Spirit Spring,

10:42.280 --> 10:44.190
[Lu Yun, Sovereign of Scud Sect]

10:42.750 --> 10:44.630
yet it sensed an abnormality last night?

10:45.000 --> 10:46.000
Unfortunately,

10:46.390 --> 10:47.870
the abnormality flashed by.

10:48.120 --> 10:50.240
It's hard to locate the Spirit Spring.

10:50.770 --> 10:51.770
We still have no clue

10:51.030 --> 10:53.870
[Immortal Kaiyuan, Sovereign of Eternal Sect]

10:51.870 --> 10:53.790
where that cunning Mu Qingge

10:54.030 --> 10:55.510
actually hid

10:55.750 --> 10:57.360
the Spirit Spring.

10:57.750 --> 11:00.510
Mount Absolute's Reincarnation Fruit has fallen.

11:00.720 --> 11:02.600
If the demoness reappears

11:02.690 --> 11:04.140
and summons the Spirit Spring,

11:02.960 --> 11:05.320
[Cang Hengjun, Sovereign of Sun Sect]

11:04.650 --> 11:06.020
the universe will be in chaos.

11:06.110 --> 11:07.070
Mount Absolute's barrier

11:06.530 --> 11:09.520
[Wen Yi'an, Sovereign of Hollow Sect]

11:07.120 --> 11:08.490
was set up by Su Yishui.

11:08.720 --> 11:10.510
A visit to Mount Wester will give us the answer.

11:20.550 --> 11:21.080
Guardian.

11:24.250 --> 11:27.040
[Yan Liangyu, Sovereign of Eternal Sect]

11:24.250 --> 11:27.040
[Wen Hongshan, Elder of Hollow Sect]

11:24.430 --> 11:25.220
Sovereign Su.

11:25.720 --> 11:27.510
We were ordered to come here

11:27.870 --> 11:29.080
for Mount Absolute's matter.

11:29.670 --> 11:30.790
Sovereign Su.

11:31.120 --> 11:32.730
Have you been there recently?

11:33.120 --> 11:33.720
No.

11:34.960 --> 11:35.550
Yishui.

11:35.750 --> 11:36.490
Here's the thing.

11:36.720 --> 11:37.590
A few days ago,

11:37.630 --> 11:38.840
Wei Jiu led the Scarlets

11:38.860 --> 11:40.130
to make a scene below Mount Absolute.

11:40.240 --> 11:41.390
The Demon Detector also sensed an abnormality

11:41.410 --> 11:42.210
with the Spirit Spring.

11:42.440 --> 11:43.270
Everyone is worried that

11:43.440 --> 11:45.030
something's wrong with the Reincarnation Tree.

11:53.510 --> 11:54.790
Mount Absolute's Barrier is fine.

11:55.150 --> 11:57.000
Mu Qingge hasn’t been reborn.

11:57.600 --> 11:59.320
She has nothing to do with the abnormality.

12:00.960 --> 12:02.410
You set the barrier

12:02.630 --> 12:04.150
and opened this Water Mirror.

12:04.390 --> 12:05.390
How can you prove it's true?

12:05.790 --> 12:06.510
Yan Liangyu.

12:07.120 --> 12:08.110
Stop talking.

12:08.240 --> 12:10.080
Don't be so anxious to protect him.

12:10.550 --> 12:11.390
The abnormality

12:11.410 --> 12:12.600
concerns the safety of the universe.

12:13.240 --> 12:13.790
Today,

12:14.030 --> 12:14.630
either give me

12:14.630 --> 12:16.070
a more persuasive answer

12:16.510 --> 12:17.970
or open the barrier at Mount Absolute

12:18.000 --> 12:19.510
for us to inspect on the spot.

12:20.000 --> 12:21.120
Don't patronize me with all these.

12:21.600 --> 12:23.030
If you don't believe me, why are you here?

12:24.230 --> 12:25.920
Go guard Mount Absolute yourself.

12:26.150 --> 12:26.750
You...

12:33.440 --> 12:34.720
What are you doing

12:34.790 --> 12:36.240
in your room every day?

12:36.550 --> 12:37.910
Come eavesdrop with me.

12:38.480 --> 12:39.120
Do you know

12:39.220 --> 12:40.170
Elder Wen of Hollow Sect

12:40.200 --> 12:41.390
is here to visit?

12:41.550 --> 12:43.240
Eighteen years ago,

12:43.270 --> 12:45.310
Master and she were the perfect couple.

12:45.800 --> 12:47.480
But our founder got in the way

12:47.510 --> 12:48.840
and broke them up.

12:49.400 --> 12:50.960
Founder Mu even ruthlessly

12:50.980 --> 12:52.220
disfigured Elder Wen.

12:53.480 --> 12:54.270
How exciting!

12:56.720 --> 12:57.480
Xi'er.

12:58.150 --> 12:59.390
I'm not interested.

13:01.000 --> 13:01.750
What matters is

13:01.750 --> 13:03.390
the wine I brewed will be ready today.

13:04.360 --> 13:05.390
It's forbidden to

13:05.510 --> 13:07.200
go behind this forest in Mount Wester.

13:07.670 --> 13:09.150
No one is allowed to enter.

13:09.680 --> 13:10.520
Isn’t it just where

13:10.550 --> 13:12.390
the demoness Mu Qingge's Consonance Palace is?

13:12.870 --> 13:13.600
After she died,

13:13.600 --> 13:15.000
the Palace sealed itself up with a barrier.

13:15.390 --> 13:16.910
Since you're guests at Mount Wester,

13:17.150 --> 13:18.720
you should follow our rules!

13:19.200 --> 13:19.790
Rules?

13:20.270 --> 13:21.320
It varies from person to person.

13:21.550 --> 13:22.720
Your power weakens as you get

13:22.720 --> 13:23.670
closer to the Palace.

13:23.960 --> 13:25.750
That's why it is out of bounds.

13:25.910 --> 13:27.200
If you losers are going to

13:27.270 --> 13:28.620
be cowards, move aside!

13:29.620 --> 13:30.340
What did you say?

13:30.960 --> 13:31.600
Losers?

13:36.570 --> 13:37.810
Why don't we

13:38.140 --> 13:39.210
find out?

13:44.670 --> 13:46.040
Admit it now?

13:47.320 --> 13:48.030
Stop!

13:51.320 --> 13:52.390
They're not as skilled

13:52.410 --> 13:53.360
and have lost to you.

13:53.550 --> 13:54.840
Do you have to be so aggressive?

13:56.150 --> 13:56.750
Little girl.

13:57.330 --> 13:58.660
You want to shield them?

14:01.360 --> 14:02.320
Fine.

14:02.930 --> 14:04.530
I'll play with you then.

14:10.200 --> 14:10.670
Senior!

14:10.690 --> 14:11.090
Senior!

14:11.440 --> 14:11.910
Senior.

14:16.280 --> 14:17.990
Who made you king here?

14:27.040 --> 14:27.890
Su Yishui.

14:28.670 --> 14:29.790
Should a sovereign

14:30.080 --> 14:31.440
be so spiteful to the juniors?

14:33.240 --> 14:35.240
I've made it clear 18 years ago that

14:36.030 --> 14:36.750
I, Su Yishui,

14:36.770 --> 14:38.130
play by my own rules.

14:40.200 --> 14:41.600
Let go of my disciples!

14:42.080 --> 14:42.720
Yan Liangyu!

14:44.360 --> 14:44.960
Don't.

14:48.750 --> 14:49.510
Yishui.

14:50.630 --> 14:51.670
Let them go.

14:54.930 --> 14:55.390
You...

15:00.870 --> 15:01.270
Get lost!

15:05.910 --> 15:06.550
Let's go.

15:20.310 --> 15:21.320
What an overreacher.

15:24.750 --> 15:27.510
[Ice Lotus Pool, Mount Wester]

15:33.260 --> 15:34.050
So eager to be the great hero

15:34.080 --> 15:34.910
for others?

15:35.870 --> 15:36.630
If anything happens to you,

15:36.910 --> 15:38.120
there might not even be a next time!

15:38.670 --> 15:39.720
I'll do the same next time.

15:40.240 --> 15:41.150
I'm weak,

15:41.390 --> 15:43.080
but I can't ignore injustice.

15:43.670 --> 15:44.200
You...

15:44.680 --> 15:45.770
Just punish me now

15:46.000 --> 15:46.790
all you want.

15:54.910 --> 15:55.630
Then stay here

15:56.230 --> 15:57.730
until you've recited mantras for four hours.

16:03.750 --> 16:05.480
I don't trust that evil man.

16:06.000 --> 16:06.750
He's just

16:06.750 --> 16:08.030
protecting his Tonic Core.

16:11.870 --> 16:13.270
Throughout the ice-cold ages,

16:13.510 --> 16:14.730
everything is still.

16:15.200 --> 16:16.720
With a heart as clear as ice,

16:17.630 --> 16:19.150
I'm fearless even if the sky collapses.

16:26.320 --> 16:27.150
This is good.

16:27.750 --> 16:28.920
The chill is here too.

16:29.120 --> 16:30.480
I'm almost at the last step.

16:35.910 --> 16:36.600
Ling Xiao!

16:39.150 --> 16:39.910
I never know

16:40.360 --> 16:41.200
until the end.

16:41.750 --> 16:42.670
I can't give up.

16:47.950 --> 16:49.000
Relinquish all desires;

16:49.560 --> 16:50.710
Only hard work pays off.

16:51.440 --> 16:52.490
Keep my rich emotions in control,

16:52.960 --> 16:54.080
and the universe is mine.

17:23.650 --> 17:24.800
The Heavenly Sects' barriers

17:24.829 --> 17:25.790
are so well guarded

17:26.079 --> 17:27.589
that I can't even detect the Fruit's energy?

17:28.490 --> 17:28.970
My Lord.

17:29.200 --> 17:30.640
Why don't I send someone to sneak in—

17:30.660 --> 17:31.490
Do I need your advice?

17:32.640 --> 17:34.070
I have plenty of tricks.

17:34.480 --> 17:35.720
It just takes a little effort.

17:36.820 --> 17:38.130
Go to that girl's home

17:38.160 --> 17:39.160
below Mount Absolute

17:39.510 --> 17:41.030
and bring me something.

17:42.350 --> 17:42.790
Yes,

17:42.820 --> 17:43.400
My Lord.

17:49.350 --> 17:50.790
He actually told me to ignore

17:50.810 --> 17:51.650
those in need of help.

17:51.920 --> 17:53.070
Is he even an immortal cultivator?

17:54.480 --> 17:55.790
No, thank you.

17:57.860 --> 17:58.910
[Carefree Pavilion, Mount Wester]

18:00.880 --> 18:02.550
What's so strange about Guardian's sword

18:02.550 --> 18:03.510
being hidden in the ruins?

18:03.980 --> 18:05.160
I'm just curious.

18:05.550 --> 18:06.210
But...

18:06.230 --> 18:07.720
his sword is a precious weapon.

18:08.070 --> 18:09.720
It needs to absorb moonlight at the altar in Carefree Pavilion

18:09.720 --> 18:10.680
every night.

18:11.200 --> 18:12.710
At this hour, that evil man

18:13.030 --> 18:14.720
would be meditating in the Ice Lotus Pool.

18:23.830 --> 18:24.680
He's really not here.

18:46.310 --> 18:47.010
Ling Xiao!

18:47.110 --> 18:47.750
You really

18:47.750 --> 18:48.750
regain some strength

18:48.990 --> 18:50.200
when you're near the Blood Chalcedony.

19:01.920 --> 19:04.230
He even hid a dress?

19:07.960 --> 19:08.880
Is it unrequited love

19:08.900 --> 19:10.860
or some special fetish of his?

19:11.880 --> 19:12.550
Whatever.

19:12.680 --> 19:13.920
Focus on the Blood Chalcedony.

19:16.420 --> 19:18.100
My pouch he confiscated!

19:19.550 --> 19:20.750
I wonder if there's a talisman

19:20.750 --> 19:21.830
that could pry away

19:21.850 --> 19:22.680
the Blood Chalcedony.

19:23.750 --> 19:24.270
Got it,

19:24.910 --> 19:26.000
the Load-Reduction Talisman.

19:33.650 --> 19:34.520
My good wine...

19:34.550 --> 19:35.640
What a pity.

19:40.000 --> 19:41.210
S-Sorry, Master!

19:41.240 --> 19:42.830
I-I entered the wrong room!

20:02.130 --> 20:03.680
It's a Water Mirror.

20:04.340 --> 20:05.730
According to the "Treasure Encyclopedia,"

20:06.110 --> 20:07.070
it can teleport you

20:07.090 --> 20:08.440
to any place you want to go.

21:00.680 --> 21:01.680
Luckily, I still have

21:01.960 --> 21:02.940
an Invisibility Talisman.

21:23.440 --> 21:25.590
He does have a beautiful figure.

21:26.270 --> 21:27.200
I heard he used to

21:27.200 --> 21:28.960
be as beautiful as the moon

21:29.600 --> 21:31.160
before his face and body

21:31.650 --> 21:33.870
were disfigured by the Burning Curse

21:34.200 --> 21:35.510
cast by Mu Qingge.

21:37.510 --> 21:38.440
What a pity.

21:39.070 --> 21:41.310
This master and disciple are really inextricably entangled.

21:41.330 --> 21:42.720
Their hatred lives on beyond death.

21:48.400 --> 21:48.920
Xue Ranran.

21:49.270 --> 21:50.440
Why are you focusing on such

21:50.440 --> 21:51.240
nonsense now?

21:51.590 --> 21:52.510
I must escape

21:52.680 --> 21:54.030
once I get the Blood Chalcedony.

22:05.510 --> 22:06.340
Xue Ranran.

22:07.550 --> 22:08.880
What are you doing in my room?

22:10.490 --> 22:11.220
I was wrong.

22:11.440 --> 22:12.980
I shouldn't have barged into your room.

22:13.480 --> 22:14.000
I...

22:15.420 --> 22:16.900
just wanted to get back this pouch.

22:35.270 --> 22:36.160
You know Su Yu?

22:38.110 --> 22:39.030
How do you know him?

22:40.360 --> 22:41.800
He knows Young Master Yu?

22:43.240 --> 22:44.480
I just

22:45.000 --> 22:46.640
met him by chance.

22:49.860 --> 22:50.990
A chance encounter,

22:51.320 --> 22:52.690
yet you value his pouch so much?

22:53.750 --> 22:55.200
If he doesn't believe my explanation

22:55.510 --> 22:57.160
and finds out that I'm here for the Blood Chalcedony,

22:57.180 --> 22:58.390
I won't get a second chance at this.

23:01.070 --> 23:01.720
It's...

23:03.080 --> 23:04.560
just my wishful thinking,

23:05.240 --> 23:06.130
but I am

23:06.160 --> 23:07.750
in love with him.

23:08.440 --> 23:09.270
In love?

23:15.070 --> 23:16.110
So I

23:16.310 --> 23:17.680
really missed this pouch.

23:30.920 --> 23:31.710
Master.

23:38.820 --> 23:39.540
Master?

23:43.920 --> 23:45.160
What did you do to me?

23:51.940 --> 23:53.450
Master's such a lightweight

23:54.160 --> 23:55.720
that he got drunk from soaking in the wine?

24:10.750 --> 24:12.580
The Load-Reduction Talisman is amazing.

24:15.720 --> 24:17.690
Master, you're usually so boring.

24:17.800 --> 24:18.790
Now that you're drunk,

24:19.110 --> 24:21.000
why don't you sing and dance freely?

24:24.110 --> 24:25.270
Indulge in drunkenness

24:25.480 --> 24:26.480
and live like there's no tomorrow.

24:39.270 --> 24:40.020
Thanks.

24:46.990 --> 24:48.230
Qingge...

24:56.110 --> 24:57.760
Why does the barrier change at night?

24:57.880 --> 24:58.310
I...

24:58.550 --> 25:00.070
I can't find the way down the mountain.

25:02.200 --> 25:03.590
Luckily, I brought the jade tablet.

25:06.070 --> 25:07.130
Tablet, show me the way!

25:09.860 --> 25:11.070
Show me the way!

25:21.310 --> 25:22.140
Little kitty.

25:22.170 --> 25:23.560
I'm running out of time.

25:23.790 --> 25:24.960
When that evil man wakes up,

25:24.960 --> 25:26.110
he'll catch up with me!

25:28.750 --> 25:29.240
Little kitty.

25:30.070 --> 25:31.680
Do you know the way down the mountain?

25:32.310 --> 25:33.400
If you take me out of here,

25:33.680 --> 25:34.960
I'll give you all my jerky.

25:41.560 --> 25:44.790
[Consonance Palace, Mount Wester]

25:47.570 --> 25:49.290
[Consonance Palace]

25:49.750 --> 25:51.240
The demoness' Consonance Palace?

25:54.830 --> 25:56.550
Go down the mountain from here?

26:23.340 --> 26:24.620
Wine recipes!

26:27.350 --> 26:28.350
Food recipes!

26:31.200 --> 26:32.490
Magic spells.

26:34.400 --> 26:35.640
What a variety.

26:36.000 --> 26:37.720
She really was devoted to the study of pleasure.

26:38.750 --> 26:39.720
It's plausible

26:39.810 --> 26:41.290
that someone like her

26:41.320 --> 26:42.360
abducted a handsome man.

26:43.110 --> 26:44.440
But being the ruler of the universe?

26:44.960 --> 26:45.550
I don't think so.

26:49.030 --> 26:50.030
The map of Mount Wester!

27:00.480 --> 27:01.510
Face-and-Heart Burning Curse?

27:02.880 --> 27:04.200
There are only two solutions.

27:04.310 --> 27:06.400
Those who're cursed must either plead the caster

27:07.000 --> 27:07.680
for forgiveness

27:07.920 --> 27:09.590
or attain ascension.

27:14.830 --> 27:15.720
So,

27:16.640 --> 27:17.270
that evil man

27:17.270 --> 27:18.640
wants my Formless Spirit Root

27:18.830 --> 27:19.730
to attain ascension

27:20.000 --> 27:20.720
to remove

27:20.720 --> 27:21.880
his Burning Curse.

27:22.670 --> 27:23.950
No wonder he took me up the mountain.

27:24.240 --> 27:25.270
I have to leave now.

27:45.490 --> 27:50.420
♫Fallen leaves swirling and covering the empty garden♫

27:52.260 --> 27:57.550
♫Clouds and dust rolling in the distant sky♫

27:58.930 --> 28:01.950
♫Generations of dreams fold into one♫

27:59.510 --> 28:00.270
Qingge.

28:02.390 --> 28:04.950
♫Solitary branches hidden in clothing♫

28:05.770 --> 28:12.200
♫Extend fate to call you back; How lucky to meet by chance♫

28:08.640 --> 28:09.550
You’re back.

28:10.440 --> 28:11.640
What's going on?

28:11.920 --> 28:13.310
Is he still drunk

28:13.440 --> 28:14.590
and thinks I'm Mu Qingge?

28:21.680 --> 28:22.510
I’m leaving.

28:23.030 --> 28:23.510
Don't go!

28:26.000 --> 28:27.480
The tree you planted has grown up.

28:28.400 --> 28:29.680
It bears fruits every year.

28:30.440 --> 28:31.440
You haven't tried them yet.

28:35.000 --> 28:35.440
Y-You...

28:35.440 --> 28:36.000
Don't come near me!

28:42.270 --> 28:43.160
Xue Ranran!

28:43.610 --> 28:44.500
Founder Mu.

28:44.920 --> 28:47.070
Y-You've really appeared.

28:47.770 --> 28:48.830
Don't get a small fry

28:49.030 --> 28:49.680
like me

28:49.680 --> 28:50.720
involved in your feud.

28:51.440 --> 28:52.480
Swords, the treacherous one

28:52.680 --> 28:53.510
who killed his master

28:53.640 --> 28:54.240
is him!

28:55.000 --> 28:55.520
Xue Ranran.

28:55.720 --> 28:56.270
Come over!

28:58.200 --> 28:59.480
It seems the angrier he is,

28:59.790 --> 29:00.510
the more the Spirit Swords

29:00.510 --> 29:01.480
target him.

29:03.640 --> 29:04.310
Su Yishui.

29:04.860 --> 29:06.100
Don't think I don't know

29:06.160 --> 29:07.400
what you want from me.

29:07.920 --> 29:09.440
Everyone says you're aloof and noble.

29:09.720 --> 29:10.720
I think it's bullcrap.

29:11.480 --> 29:12.310
Do you dare to admit

29:12.490 --> 29:13.280
why you tricked me

29:13.310 --> 29:14.030
to this mountain?

29:14.490 --> 29:15.520
You just want

29:15.550 --> 29:16.640
my Formless Spirit Root

29:16.640 --> 29:17.320
for your cultivation!

29:18.200 --> 29:19.590
How do you know about the Formless Spirit Root?

29:20.270 --> 29:22.000
What is done by night, appears by day.

29:22.310 --> 29:23.440
I won't let you succeed.

29:23.790 --> 29:24.950
I'll run so far away

29:25.000 --> 29:26.060
so you never find me!

29:26.750 --> 29:27.350
You can't leave!

29:28.200 --> 29:29.480
You'll die if you leave Mount Wester.

29:29.960 --> 29:31.350
I'll die if I stay!

29:32.240 --> 29:33.740
You dared to kill your own master.

29:33.880 --> 29:34.510
What else

29:34.510 --> 29:35.160
can't you do?

29:36.080 --> 29:37.080
If your master cursed you

29:37.110 --> 29:38.110
with the Burning Curse,

29:38.400 --> 29:39.360
you should accept it.

29:39.750 --> 29:41.150
Even plotting to lift the curse?

29:41.350 --> 29:42.200
Dream on!

29:43.950 --> 29:44.500
Xue Ranran!

29:45.830 --> 29:46.400
Xue Ranran!

29:52.510 --> 29:53.350
Greetings, My Lord.

29:53.790 --> 29:54.390
Here it is.

29:57.310 --> 29:59.510
Are you planning to use this to enter the consciousness

29:59.700 --> 30:00.950
of the Reincarnation Fruit?

30:03.630 --> 30:05.150
Although this magic spell is profound,

30:05.340 --> 30:05.930
if that girl

30:05.960 --> 30:07.400
is really in the hands of a Heavenly Sect,

30:07.430 --> 30:09.260
the sect's mountain will have a barrier.

30:10.030 --> 30:10.670
I'm afraid

30:11.270 --> 30:12.550
the spell will be blocked.

30:13.310 --> 30:14.550
That's because you're weak.

30:15.490 --> 30:17.550
I’m near the peak of Nascent Soul cultivation.

30:17.880 --> 30:20.510
Would I be threatened by mere barriers

30:20.510 --> 30:21.400
of the Heavenly Sects?

30:22.270 --> 30:23.930
As long as she's in flesh and blood,

30:24.130 --> 30:26.220
no matter where she is,

30:26.520 --> 30:28.000
entering her consciousness

30:28.310 --> 30:29.720
will just be child's play.

30:33.550 --> 30:37.710
[Yinxia Town]

30:39.000 --> 30:39.480
Miss.

30:40.070 --> 30:40.790
Miss, wake up.

30:44.170 --> 30:45.410
I can only send you till here.

30:45.880 --> 30:46.720
To get to the capital,

30:46.960 --> 30:47.750
you have to rent

30:47.750 --> 30:48.750
a carriage in the city.

30:54.350 --> 30:55.590
Miss, are you okay?

30:55.850 --> 30:57.080
You look

30:57.160 --> 30:58.000
a bit pale.

30:58.750 --> 31:00.030
Maybe I caught a cold while traveling

31:00.050 --> 31:00.960
all night.

31:01.750 --> 31:02.680
We've come some way

31:02.700 --> 31:03.770
from Mount Wester, yeah?

31:04.000 --> 31:05.210
About 30 miles away.

31:07.440 --> 31:08.070
Thank you.

31:25.840 --> 31:27.490
This is what life is all about!

31:36.750 --> 31:38.260
[Guixia Inn]

31:44.030 --> 31:45.690
I can't believe such a lousy jade tablet

31:45.750 --> 31:47.440
could be pawned for ten taels of silver.

31:52.480 --> 31:53.270
Evil Su.

31:53.640 --> 31:54.240
Thanks a lot.

32:02.200 --> 32:03.310
Why's it tasteless?

32:08.680 --> 32:09.920
Why's this tasteless too?

32:10.790 --> 32:11.960
Did my sense of taste get removed

32:11.960 --> 32:13.450
during my refining sessions

32:13.480 --> 32:14.680
in Mount Wester?

32:16.070 --> 32:16.480
No.

32:16.790 --> 32:18.080
I must feast until I restore

32:18.110 --> 32:19.480
all my mortal senses and instincts.

32:26.900 --> 32:27.680
What's going on?

32:33.960 --> 32:34.640
Are you okay?

32:37.530 --> 32:38.500
M-Miss?

32:39.310 --> 32:39.880
Miss!

32:41.110 --> 32:41.790
Manager!

32:42.110 --> 32:43.500
What should we do?

32:43.750 --> 32:44.920
She can't die in our shop!

32:45.360 --> 32:45.920
Manager.

32:46.120 --> 32:46.950
Let's contact the authorities.

32:47.030 --> 32:48.000
Let them handle this.

32:48.540 --> 32:49.410
Yes, the authorities.

32:49.440 --> 32:50.110
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

32:52.640 --> 32:53.640
Nonsense.

32:54.270 --> 32:55.880
I still have a lot of time left.

32:56.240 --> 32:57.350
I won't die.

33:14.680 --> 33:15.200
Huh?

33:15.550 --> 33:16.580
What happened?

33:20.160 --> 33:20.790
You can't leave!

33:21.720 --> 33:23.000
You'll die if you leave Mount Wester.

33:25.440 --> 33:26.680
Was that not

33:27.110 --> 33:28.480
actually a threat?

33:29.240 --> 33:30.960
I really can't leave Mount Wester?

33:32.370 --> 33:33.460
I can't die.

33:34.190 --> 33:35.590
I haven't saved Ling Xiao.

33:35.920 --> 33:36.640
There are still so many

33:36.640 --> 33:38.110
delicious foods and fun things I haven't tried.

33:38.270 --> 33:39.310
I can't die.

33:41.830 --> 33:43.160
Throughout the ice-cold ages,

33:43.310 --> 33:44.400
everything is still.

33:48.750 --> 33:50.070
Throughout the ice-cold ages,

33:51.440 --> 33:52.750
everything is still.

33:53.680 --> 33:55.160
With a heart as clear as ice,

33:56.130 --> 33:57.610
I'm fearless even if the sky collapses.

33:59.160 --> 34:00.590
Relinquish all desires;

34:01.870 --> 34:03.500
Only hard work pays off.

34:10.060 --> 34:10.770
Found it.

34:24.150 --> 34:25.440
Enter her consciousness.

34:32.760 --> 34:34.590
[Consciousness]

34:46.530 --> 34:48.460
It is the Reincarnation Fruit's consciousness.

34:49.110 --> 34:50.400
I finally found you.

35:09.550 --> 35:10.280
Who is it?

35:16.710 --> 35:17.670
It's you again!

35:18.500 --> 35:19.250
You keep trying

35:19.280 --> 35:20.450
to take the person I want.

35:20.960 --> 35:21.480
Damn you!

35:57.110 --> 35:58.390
Her consciousness is destroyed

35:58.670 --> 35:59.510
and she's dead!

36:00.800 --> 36:01.920
You ruined my plan!

36:13.180 --> 36:14.710
The spiritual energy of this Fruit

36:15.220 --> 36:16.380
isn't Mu Qingge's.

36:46.480 --> 36:46.920
Oh no.

36:47.550 --> 36:48.800
It's the consciousness invasion.

36:56.110 --> 36:57.150
I didn't expect Wei Jiu

36:57.150 --> 36:58.190
to be so powerful now.

36:59.280 --> 37:00.080
If I don't put an end

37:00.110 --> 37:01.440
to this Reincarnation Fruit,

37:01.530 --> 37:02.660
he won't give up.

37:06.530 --> 37:07.730
The Golden Core energy in Ranran's body

37:07.760 --> 37:08.480
is the same as mine.

37:09.110 --> 37:10.280
I can use this to transfer

37:10.300 --> 37:11.110
the formation to me

37:12.040 --> 37:13.480
and lure Wei Jiu into my consciousness

37:13.510 --> 37:14.230
to make him give up.

37:33.840 --> 37:34.360
You're awake.

37:54.210 --> 37:57.710
♫Who is that alone under the tree?♫

37:57.840 --> 37:58.190
Here.

37:58.570 --> 37:59.340
Drink this.

37:58.830 --> 38:03.980
♫Stained with a light and clear glow♫

38:02.000 --> 38:03.480
Black Dragon's blood can conceal your energy

38:04.280 --> 38:05.360
so Wei Jiu can't find you anymore.

38:04.390 --> 38:08.850
♫Repeatedly awakened from dreams by the shattered shadow of the moon♫

38:09.600 --> 38:15.110
♫Outside the mountain, longing reflected in the limpid eyes♫

38:16.920 --> 38:20.600
♫With a gentle nudge of the night breeze, the lantern is empty♫

38:21.220 --> 38:26.440
♫Time passed can never be brought back♫

38:26.150 --> 38:26.630
I...

38:26.840 --> 38:28.280
Let's talk when you feel better.

38:26.930 --> 38:32.230
♫On sleepless nights, I toast to the world and drown my sorrows♫

38:32.320 --> 38:33.410
Now, will you trust me

38:32.490 --> 38:37.720
♫My lovesickness comprises only of you♫

38:33.640 --> 38:34.600
and return to Mount Wester with me?

38:38.000 --> 38:43.800
♫If the long night is too dark, I'll keep you company all the way♫

38:42.920 --> 38:44.440
Master saved me.

38:43.820 --> 38:48.930
♫To face all the love and hatred, the rights and wrongs♫

38:49.220 --> 38:55.180
♫Our tortuous fate alternating endlessly between partings and reunions, joy and sorrow♫

38:55.280 --> 39:00.480
♫Only after experiencing death and rebirth do you realize its preciousness♫

39:00.500 --> 39:06.250
♫A destiny full of twists and turns, a love fraught with hardship♫

39:06.380 --> 39:11.550
♫But I remain fearless with no regrets♫

39:11.940 --> 39:17.750
♫Waiting for the fallen flowers to dance and silhouettes to pair up♫

39:17.910 --> 39:24.380
♫Eventually nestling in each other's arms again♫

39:35.970 --> 39:39.880
♫With a gentle nudge of the night breeze, the lantern is empty♫

39:40.270 --> 39:45.230
♫Time passed can never be brought back♫

39:45.480 --> 39:51.030
♫On sleepless nights, I toast to the world and drown my sorrows♫

39:51.420 --> 39:56.390
♫My lovesickness comprises only of you♫

40:09.840 --> 40:10.280
Guardian.

40:10.480 --> 40:11.320
Mr. Zeng is here.

40:29.510 --> 40:31.110
It's been days since I've seen your face,

40:31.670 --> 40:33.190
but it's still as annoying.

40:36.280 --> 40:37.840
You've been practicing the Ice Lotus Technique so much

40:38.060 --> 40:39.500
that you're turning into a lump of ice.

40:38.150 --> 40:40.400
[Zeng Yi, disciple of Mu Qingge]

40:39.880 --> 40:41.110
Zero warmth.

40:42.070 --> 40:43.280
I called you here for something serious,

40:43.670 --> 40:44.670
not to listen to your nonsense.

40:46.550 --> 40:47.360
How is Master?

40:56.440 --> 40:57.070
Master.

40:58.440 --> 40:59.990
So this is how she looks like in this life.

41:01.280 --> 41:01.880
You really

41:01.880 --> 41:03.030
disguised her appearance well.

41:09.510 --> 41:10.800
You sent a letter that

41:10.920 --> 41:11.960
Master isn't feeling well

41:12.150 --> 41:12.950
and might be in danger.

41:13.400 --> 41:14.470
What's going on?

41:15.490 --> 41:16.960
Her Reincarnation Fruit

41:16.960 --> 41:17.880
fell too early,

41:18.930 --> 41:19.810
so she was born

41:19.840 --> 41:20.630
with a broken heart.

41:21.310 --> 41:22.480
She can only survive by relying

41:22.510 --> 41:23.440
on the Reincarnation Tree's

41:23.460 --> 41:24.230
spiritual power.

41:25.360 --> 41:26.360
If she's too far from the Tree,

41:26.800 --> 41:27.920
her life will be in danger.

41:29.030 --> 41:30.110
How could this happen?

41:31.670 --> 41:32.920
She even showed signs of premature aging

41:33.360 --> 41:34.070
after running

41:34.070 --> 41:35.070
away from the mountain.

41:36.710 --> 41:38.000
Something's off.

41:38.190 --> 41:38.840
So I need you to

41:38.840 --> 41:39.710
examine her with your energy.

41:50.110 --> 41:51.710
This Mirror will take half an hour.

41:57.510 --> 41:58.320
Once I got here,

41:58.320 --> 41:59.590
I asked Yu Tong about everything.

42:00.480 --> 42:02.190
Since you brought her to Mount Wester,

42:02.550 --> 42:04.110
you've always been cold to her.

42:04.510 --> 42:05.280
You even kept making her

42:05.280 --> 42:05.920
go to intense places

42:06.070 --> 42:07.230
like the Ice Lotus Pool or Westerly Valley.

42:08.020 --> 42:09.040
I know you want to

42:09.070 --> 42:10.320
cleanse her meridians quickly.

42:10.800 --> 42:12.400
But without spiritual foundation,

42:12.920 --> 42:14.110
how can she bear it?

42:14.760 --> 42:15.630
Now, I'm her master

42:15.630 --> 42:16.440
and she's my disciple.

42:16.920 --> 42:17.920
How I discipline her

42:17.920 --> 42:18.510
is up to me.

42:19.190 --> 42:19.710
Besides,

42:19.880 --> 42:20.920
my army's efforts were in vain

42:21.190 --> 42:22.510
because she nullified my techniques.

42:23.110 --> 42:23.960
I'm already being

42:23.960 --> 42:24.880
as gracious as I can.

42:25.030 --> 42:26.070
I'm at my limit.

42:27.670 --> 42:28.840
After so many years,

42:29.480 --> 42:30.670
you've only become more stubborn.

42:32.030 --> 42:32.840
Back then, Master knew

42:32.860 --> 42:34.210
you were about to attain ascension

42:34.880 --> 42:35.920
and so the Burning Curse

42:35.940 --> 42:36.650
will be lifted.

42:37.150 --> 42:38.320
If you really hate her,

42:38.710 --> 42:40.030
why'd you give up your ascension

42:40.240 --> 42:41.720
and half of your Golden Core to save her?

42:42.840 --> 42:44.150
You even claimed it was

42:44.150 --> 42:45.230
about saving

42:45.230 --> 42:45.960
Wester Sect.

42:45.980 --> 42:46.940
How ridiculous.

42:47.670 --> 42:48.860
She did die because of me.

42:49.440 --> 42:50.400
I owe her my life.

42:51.410 --> 42:52.490
Once her heart is stable

42:52.710 --> 42:53.430
and she's self-sufficient,

42:53.460 --> 42:54.540
I'll make her leave right away.

42:56.030 --> 42:56.760
Don't lie.

42:58.400 --> 43:00.240
You were a difficult person a dozen years ago.

43:00.800 --> 43:01.440
Now,

43:01.440 --> 43:02.630
you're still as difficult.

43:03.480 --> 43:04.630
In my opinion,

43:05.240 --> 43:06.680
you just regret what happened back then.

43:11.960 --> 43:15.390
[22 years ago]
[Unmarked Cemetery]
